# Issue API Requests

### Create an issue in a repository
POST http://localhost:4000/issue-api/69b79e1eeea7d84955bfca4d/issues
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Bug report",
  "description": "Description of the issue",
  "status": "open"
}

### Get all issues in a repository
GET http://localhost:4000/issue-api/69b79e1eeea7d84955bfca4d/issues

### Get a specific issue
GET http://localhost:4000/issue-api/issue/69b8da20d4f5f802426f632f

### Update an issue
PUT http://localhost:4000/issue-api/issue/69b8da20d4f5f802426f632f
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Updated bug report",
  "description": "Updated description",
  "status": "closed"
}

### Delete an issue
DELETE http://localhost:4000/issue-api/issue/69b8da20d4f5f802426f632f